WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.142 --> 00:00:07.725
(upbeat music)

00:00:09.189 --> 00:00:10.917
(laughing)

00:00:10.917 --> 00:00:12.341
- It's a joke. Right?

00:00:12.341 --> 00:00:14.508
(sighing)

00:00:15.672 --> 00:00:18.113
- I have it good but--

00:00:18.113 --> 00:00:19.984
- It takes forever!

00:00:19.984 --> 00:00:22.343
- I would rather be locked up in a cage

00:00:22.343 --> 00:00:25.191
with anacondas for an hour.

00:00:25.191 --> 00:00:28.203
- I'm worried that I might not
remember the capital letters.

00:00:28.203 --> 00:00:29.747
- Capital letters.

00:00:29.747 --> 00:00:32.968
- Aren't you supposed to do it all in one?

00:00:32.968 --> 00:00:34.986
I'm not doing that.

00:00:34.986 --> 00:00:36.576
- Yeah.

00:00:36.576 --> 00:00:38.448
- Yeah. Sure.

00:00:38.448 --> 00:00:39.300
Give it a whirl.

00:00:39.300 --> 00:00:41.859
(drum roll)
- [Speaker] Hello.

00:00:41.859 --> 00:00:43.651
- The H should be the easiest.

00:00:43.651 --> 00:00:46.818
- I don't know the letters of cursive.

00:00:48.485 --> 00:00:51.818
Now I'm just making like bubble letters.

00:00:55.283 --> 00:00:57.071
- This is probably a level one.

00:00:57.071 --> 00:00:58.165
It was pretty easy.

00:00:58.165 --> 00:01:00.915
- This looks like the illuminati!

00:01:01.881 --> 00:01:04.209
- I think it looks weird.

00:01:04.209 --> 00:01:05.659
- Bye.

00:01:05.659 --> 00:01:07.944
(drum roll)
- [Kids] Foxes!

00:01:07.944 --> 00:01:08.777
- Okay.

00:01:11.652 --> 00:01:12.485
Ah!

00:01:13.325 --> 00:01:16.053
(exhaling)

00:01:16.053 --> 00:01:17.681
- I love foxes.

00:01:17.681 --> 00:01:19.843
Give me motivation.

00:01:19.843 --> 00:01:23.342
- This already looks pretty bad.

00:01:23.342 --> 00:01:25.004
- Is it like that?

00:01:25.004 --> 00:01:28.421
- I'm just gonna try to make fancy print.

00:01:32.696 --> 00:01:34.490
- The X'll --

00:01:34.490 --> 00:01:35.878
Oo. That looks gorgeous.

00:01:35.878 --> 00:01:38.143
- Okay. Here's my results!

00:01:38.143 --> 00:01:40.393
(laughing)

00:01:41.925 --> 00:01:43.675
- It's like a little.

00:01:44.822 --> 00:01:49.247
It's like someone saying,
"Stop making me do cursive"!

00:01:49.247 --> 00:01:51.591
(drum roll)
- [Speaker 2] I love pizza.

00:01:51.591 --> 00:01:53.957
Well. It's totally the opposite but --

00:01:53.957 --> 00:01:56.540
Yeah. I can make it a sentence.

00:01:59.239 --> 00:02:00.461
- Is that an I?

00:02:00.461 --> 00:02:02.711
(laughing)

00:02:06.376 --> 00:02:07.209
- Pretty!

00:02:08.784 --> 00:02:09.617
- Okay.

00:02:09.617 --> 00:02:11.706
That one was definitely bad.

00:02:11.706 --> 00:02:13.293
- Here's my results!

00:02:13.293 --> 00:02:15.084
(laughing)

00:02:15.084 --> 00:02:16.677
I, supposed to be capital.

00:02:16.677 --> 00:02:19.760
And I should probably add a sad face.

00:02:20.677 --> 00:02:21.510
(laughing)

00:02:21.510 --> 00:02:22.427
- 'Cause --

00:02:27.146 --> 00:02:30.569
- No. I think it's a
waste of time in school.

00:02:30.569 --> 00:02:32.461
- When you're writing a
letter to the president

00:02:32.461 --> 00:02:33.433
or someone like that.

00:02:33.433 --> 00:02:35.558
They probably would prefer cursive.

00:02:35.558 --> 00:02:38.976
So I think it's really
important for you teachers

00:02:38.976 --> 00:02:41.134
to teach your kids how to do cursive.

00:02:41.134 --> 00:02:44.026
- I'm so gonna just use
my normal handwriting.

00:02:44.026 --> 00:02:47.402
I don't want to use cursive
in the future ever again.

00:02:47.402 --> 00:02:48.907
- It's creepy.

00:02:48.907 --> 00:02:50.090
Okay cursive.

00:02:50.090 --> 00:02:50.923
No!

00:02:52.540 --> 00:02:53.957
This is horrible.

